'''Politics and elections'''
*[[2026 Bosnian general election]]
**[[Bosnia and Herzegovina|Bosnians]] vote to elect the three members of the [[Presidency of Bosnia and Herzegovina|presidency]] and 42 members of the [[House of Representatives of Bosnia and Herzegovina|House of Representatives]]. Concurrent elections are also held in the [[Federation of Bosnia and Herzegovina|Federation]] to [[2026 Federation of Bosnia and Herzegovina general election|elect 98 seats]] of the [[House of Representatives of the Federation of Bosnia and Herzegovina|regional legislature]] and in [[Republika Srpska]] to [[2026 Republika Srpska general election|elect]] the entity's [[President of Republika Srpska|president]] and the 83 seats of the [[National Assembly (Republika Srpska)|respective legislature]]. [https://www.afp.com/en/bosnia-votes-wartime-divides-drive-campaigns (AFP)]
